   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/worldly-knowledge.lua",
   "source": "Learn which category?",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "学习什么技能树？",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "b28a3a03c422620484b9cfe4b982c35fa342797b6f34f042fe6ed5b7b22aa608",
   "line": 6610,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a creature about as tall as a Halfling, covered in small white fur and with a disproportionate head.\nYou also notice he does not wield his greatsword. It seems to float in the air, bound to his will.*#WHITE#\nWhy did you save me, stranger? You are not of the Way.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前站着一个和半身人一样高的生物，拥有白色的毛发和大小不协调的脑袋。\n你同时注意到他并没有用手握持大剑，剑正漂浮在空中，仿佛受他的意志控制。*#WHITE#\n你为什么救我，陌生人？你不属于维网。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "484c063bccdabd521c2dc456df71c435c172bfa9106f6f9d8c2d4bfa9b28fd01",
   "line": 6615,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Well, you seemed to need help.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "你看上去似乎需要帮助。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "b70e09070b72184232dcc8adbbe7280f8eb1a11fde631c8ac2c9300f53fde338",
   "line": 6616,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "So I could rip your throat myself!",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "这样我可以亲自割破你的喉咙！",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "28f3c22fce02c5e5f697c43a7915bb7400249338f985831dde5f582f066448c3",
   "line": 6617,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*The greatsword floats to a less aggressive stance. He seems surprised.*#WHITE#\nThen, on behalf of the Way, I thank you.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*大剑在空中后退了些，显得不那么有敌意。他好像很吃惊。*#WHITE#\n那么，我代表维网感谢你。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "51e5e16bd203c199ed462a56363746cea7550d75e345b76f3624d3d02d78f5b7",
   "line": 6620,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "What is the Way, and what are you?",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "维网是什么，你是谁？",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "df75479b1479cde7344f696b892bb0945a9096d8171b7d15ee4f628ed7a7dbda",
   "line": 6621,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "The Way is enlightenment, peace and protection. I am a Yeek. I came through this tunnel to explore this part of the world that was closed to us for centuries.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "维网是启迪、和平和守护，我是一个夺心魔。我穿过隧道，希望探索这个已经与我们隔绝了数个世纪的地方。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "31415486a5adf908e83011b20831d17643419142df66186a828fe9c28df28f32",
   "line": 6622,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Can you tell me more about the Way?",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "你能告诉我更多有关维网的事么？",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "ad7a750f46d7898175fd3a375381d1e180ec37da1fcd3f020587589fdb6678c3",
   "line": 6623,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Select the party member to receive the mental shield:",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "选择接受精神防护的队伍成员：",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "2806410941a64a2bec9e6102661d2709d2527721fa2a2a99692227cb42bb0cc3",
   "line": 6624,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "The contact with the Wayist mind has improved your mental shields. (+15 mental save, +10%% confusion resistance)",
   "source_tag": "logPlayer",
   "special": null,
   "target": "与夺心魔的接触提高了你的精神防御。（+15精神豁免，+10%%混乱抵抗）",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "93a78a0e0c4d866ef885a17778840a86d785bab131aa9fe55c4e78968beeed52",
   "line": 6625,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "I am never alone. I have the Way.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "我并不孤单，我拥有维网。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "f5820a90e5520e52baa488ca52273800814f22ecd55e2db787884f76bd7a5550",
   "line": 6626,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Farewell, then.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "那么，再见。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "35fd73d4ae5719ef7a84e007fbc2ee0f84c5543ef182ffa3496ccae95a89a9ee",
   "line": 6627,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.*#WHITE#\nThis is the Way.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了和平和幸福。*#WHITE#\n这就是维网。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "3904715501fe47551d528dc866acad72f14b59af12c208333ca0e1ca57308520",
   "line": 6632,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Thank you for this vision. Farewell, my friend.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "谢谢你让我看到这些，再见吧，我的朋友。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "71a7d11d45de84eca2b6225bf634f570e3fb1626dd9f0d3cca33f7f8e5414f1b",
   "line": 6633,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Thank the Way. This... thing... would have killed me.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "感谢维网，这个……东西……差点杀了我。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "806129deb8cb5ec5c0c0fc3b844825fb16eb6a3d613a4935605ae679061256d8",
   "line": 6634,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "The Way sent me to explore this side of the tunnel.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "维网指引我来搜查这个隧道。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "a13053f21504ec89166ae0c3d18abd09dba44e97377eb33c343977b72ae43ed3",
   "line": 6635,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Yes, me too. We should split up to cover more ground.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "是的我也是，我们应该分头去探索这个大陆。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "27890eedb23d1a43ca1165784a646fb9a02daa3e3ca106bf1af50a6493bdc7c8",
   "line": 6636,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/yeek-wayist.lua",
   "source": "Farewell. We are the Way, always.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "再见。我们永远属于维网。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "f2d543d885e855ef6d5a343541e50834e6212b5386a5ccf7fdfb1ec3c97f4dd4",
   "line": 6641,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/zemekkys-done.lua",
   "source": "What? Ah, it is you, @playername@.\nI take it you are satisfied with the portal.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "谁？啊，原来是你，@playername@。\n我想你应该对传送门还满意。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "15bc2c67a0194e02d03aead522e50eeea0ccc744cf3f9ccea40f6df5518650e3",
   "line": 6644,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/zemekkys-done.lua",
   "source": "Yes, thank you.",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "special": null,
   "target": "是的，谢谢你。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  },
  {
   "args_order": null,
   "component": "tome",
   "entry_id": "881512fb909701b1fe519fd461ce0339aadfcc44f1b82b040cf3f0b261e97ed7",
   "line": 6645,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/zemekkys-done.lua",
   "source": "Whatever.",
   "source_tag": "chat_zemekkys-done",
   "special": null,
   "target": "还行吧。",
   "pinned_key_present": true
  }
 ],
